{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51980","headline":"（附）罗浮山八仙石题诗（旧志云：「石在药槽之下，流杯池上。相传有八仙饮於此，饮毕题诗云云。镌诸石上，岁久，字犹未甚漫灭。」） · 吕岩","name":"（附）罗浮山八仙石题诗（旧志云：「石在药槽之下，流杯池上。相传有八仙饮於此，饮毕题诗云云。镌诸石上，岁久，字犹未甚漫灭。」）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溜流青嶂泻溪湾，漱石飞云湍复旋。\n琥珀杯深谁共饮？八仙齐会贺尧年。\n（《古今图书集成·山川典》一八九《罗浮山部》，又见《罗浮山志》十）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}